*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0022
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 386
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0022.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> YEARS WITH CURRENT EMPLOYER
    05 J-TN               PIC 9(2).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 AI-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM LOAN AMOUNT
    05 ML-AMT             PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM INCOME-MULTIPLE
    DISPLAY "ML-AMT=" ML-AMT
    STOP RUN.
INCOME-MULTIPLE.
    IF J-TN >= 7
        COMPUTE ML-AMT = AI-AMT * 4
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        IF J-TN >= 2
            COMPUTE ML-AMT = AI-AMT * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE ML-AMT = AI-AMT * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
